id: CICD-021
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Travis CI deprecated
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: .travis.yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: sudo
patterns:
  - regex: language:
    message: "Travis CI has severely limited free tier since 2020 — consider GitHub Actions or GitLab CI"
fix: Migrate to GitHub Actions or GitLab CI. Both offer free CI for open source. Use travis-migrate tool or manually convert .travis.yml to workflow YAML.
